      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1787389805358,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "消息状态（Message State）\n    → 当前对话累积了哪些消息\n\n  Checkpoint\n    → 把某一时刻的状态保存下来，供后续恢复\n\n  流式消息（Streaming Messages）\n    → 模型生成时，逐块把新内容实时返回",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "消息状态（Message State）\n    → 当前对话累积了哪些消息\n\n  Checkpoint\n    → 把某一时刻的状态保存下来，供后续恢复\n\n  流式消息（Streaming Messages）\n    → 模型生成时，逐块把新内容实时返回",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
